This is an extreme case discovered in an ablation study that cluster layers by equal operators. To fix it, the `offload_remat` pass is rewritten into two parts:
the first decides which `remat_call` can be offloaded, and eliminates the computation's output;
the second finds all computations using these outputs, inserting all offloaded eqns into each user. If some eqns are inserted but is redundant, it can be eliminated by Inline+DCE in XLA.

